\par "That's the whole of it," said Dr Ramanathan. "Four instruments. Different physics in each case. Same window. Same bearing. And the departure isn't a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid4689 disturbance}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid4689 . That's what we've been arguing about. A disturbance is noise, and noise makes readings worse. These readings didn't get worse. They got\emdash "
