\par "I've spent nineteen months finding out."
\par "Then you'll know it has an energy. A floor. You cannot get rid of it and you cannot switch it off and it shows up in a great many places whether you want it to or not." He turned to the screen. "That floor is a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
