What the reader learns
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls7\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid5709733 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 
"God does not play dice" was an argument that probabilities signal incomplete description, not a distaste for uncertainty.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Einstein's EPR argument assumed locality and was refuted on that point; the possibility of a deterministic completion was not thereby closed.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Irreversible selection among live alternatives has a thermodynamic cost; a transition with only one possible outcome does not.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Absence of that cost is evidence that no selection occurred \emdash  determination, not chance.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
A superposition maintained over options that no longer exist is confined by paperwork, not by physics, and has nothing beneath it.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}A rate can conceal a reason: counting a population is not reading it.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid4160313 
