\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 Fainrose did the blackboard, because Fainrose always did the blackboard, but she did it slowly and she kept turning round.
\par "Here is what Mrs Kind has arrived at from lost luggage," she said, "and what a small number of people arrived at from black holes, and I want the department to notice that the travel agent got there with a biro."
\par She drew a box.
\par "The instinct is that the amount of stuff you can put in a region goes as its }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 volume}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 
. Twice the shelving, twice the books. It is the most obvious thing in the world and it is false." She wrote:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx916\tx1832\tx2748\tx3664\tx4580\tx5496\tx6412\tx7328\tx8244\tx9160\tx10076\tx10992\tx11908\tx12824\tx13740\tx14656\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 
