\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 
"The maximum information in a region of space is set by the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 area of its boundary}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 
, not by the volume inside. Four Planck areas per bit, near enough. Not approximately area. Area." She tapped the box. "Which means that everything that can be true inside this room is already written on the walls, and there is no room on the walls for a 
second, independent story about the interior. The interior is not an extra thing. It is a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 way of reading}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567  the walls."
\par Neville said, "Wittenberg."
\par "Wittenberg told us this in a room in Bloomsbury and we wrote it down as a nice remark about the ledger." Fainrose put the chalk down. "The ledger is on the horizon. We repeated that for nineteen months as though it were a filing convention. It is not a f
iling convention. It is the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 architecture}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 
. Four C did not have a record of its contents in the way that a warehouse has an inventory. Four C's surface }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 was}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567  the contents, and the interior was the same information described in a way that permits you to walk about in it."
\par "Two descriptions," said Mrs Kind. "One of them has three dimensions and gravity and takes a week. The other one is flat, and has no gravity in it at all, and is exactly as complete."
\par "Yes."
\par "Then may I say the thing I have come to say," said Mrs Kind, "because I have been sitting on it since the letter and I would rather be wrong out loud."
\par "Please."
\par Mrs Susie Kind opened the document case.
\par "Your fourteen did not travel," she said. "There was nowhere for them to travel to. You have a register that says a pending state must resolve to option A or option B, and you searched the interior for a third room and did not find one and concluded that 
the third room was outside the description." She laid out a page. "It was not outside the description. It was outside your }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 reading}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567  
of the description. Somebody rewrote the surface, and the interior came out differently, and from inside the interior it looks exactly like fourteen people going somewhere they could not have gone. Because that is what it is. There is no other fact."

\par "Prove it," said Fainrose, not unkindly. "You have understood something. Now make it cost you a prediction."
\par "I have one." Mrs Kind's hands were shaking slightly and her voice was not. "You measured that on the fourteenth of March nothing became cheaper by eleven parts in ten to the twenty-second, and you have been asking who was }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 pushing}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 ."
\par "We have."
\par "Nobody was pushing. There was }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 less written on the wall}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 
." She looked round the table. "If the surface is full, the vacuum costs what it costs, because the vacuum is what an entirely subscribed surface looks like from inside. If somebody clears a small amount of surface \emdash 
 deletes it, moves it, files it elsewhere \emdash  then for as long as the surface is under-subscribed, the interior is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 slack}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 . Nothing is cheaper because there is less of it to pay for. That is not an energy being supplied. It is an absence of bookkeeping."
\par The room was extremely quiet.
\par Neville said, "Say the number."
\par "I cannot do the number. I have done the shape." She turned a page round. "The shape is: ramp up, plateau, ramp down. Your Statement has it. That is not a wave passing through. That is a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 deletion and a rewrite}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567  \emdash 
 you clear, you hold the space open while you write, you close. Ninety minutes to clear. Three hours of work. Ninety minutes to reconcile." She sat back. "Mr Wren, I have watched a hundred and forty travel agencies migrate a booking system. It takes nine
ty minutes to release the records, and then the office is very strange for three hours, and then ninety minutes of matching. It is the same shape because it is the same operation. Somebody was doing an overnight run on the surface of the world."
