\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 Fainrose worked for eleven hours with Miss Pike and a numerical analyst on secondment and came back at nine that evening with a single sheet.
\par "Eleven parts in ten to the twenty-second," she said, "over the volume the four instruments were sensitive to, corresponds to a surface deficit of two point one times ten to the fifty-eight Planck areas, plus or minus a factor of two, and I want to be cle
ar that the factor of two is doing a great deal of work."
\par Beatrix said, "In English."
