\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 It was Mrs Kind who asked the question that put the chapter in the file, and she asked it apologetically, at twenty to ten, with her coat already on.
