The holographic principle, realised concretely in AdS/CFT, holds that a bulk with gravity and its boundary description without gravity are the same physics, not summary and original.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}When two descriptions produce identical relations, there is no further fact about which is real.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid15733567 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Horizon entropy, vacuum energy, and the cosmological constant are linked, so what is written on a screen and what the vacuum costs are not independent quantities.
