\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
It took four days and Mrs Kind's document case to establish what the Programme actually did, because the Programme did not describe itself in physics. It described itself in accountancy, which was worse, and then in an annex, which was fatal.
\par The mechanism was this.
\par A screen \emdash  a horizon, a boundary, any surface across which the interior is encoded \emdash  has a capacity, and it has a load. The vacuum inside is what a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
fully subscribed}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  
screen looks like from within. When a screen falls below full subscription, the interior goes slack: the price of nothing drops, barriers thin, and everything that proceeds by tunnelling proceeds faster.
\par Screens do not stay full by themselves. Information gets consolidated, records get thinned, tidy administrations reduce fat descriptions to names and dead branches, and slowly, across a volume of space, the walls develop gaps.
\par And so, since a date the instrument gave only as }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 the first arrangement}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
, forty-one signatories had paid a small annual sum into a common fund whose entire purpose was to keep the walls of the local galaxy }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 written on}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
. Not to add anything. Not to build. To maintain subscription. To go round the volume topping up screens that had gone slack, in the way that a very old and very unglamorous water company spends its whole existence keeping the pressure up in pipes nobody 
thinks about.
\par Annex C listed the consequences of under-subscription in ascending order of expense. There were nine. Neville read them at his desk with the door shut.
\par Item four was }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 anomalous resolution of pending states within the biological estate}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 .
