\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 "He's not lying," said Fainrose. She had been at the window for eleven minutes. "That is the thing I want everybody to sit with before we go to Vienna. Tegn\'e9
r has not lied. Information }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 is}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  conserved. The surface }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 is}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  
complete. Everything on that page is true and it is being used to abolish the only thing standing between this galaxy and a great many advanced supernovae, and the reason it works is that we spent nineteen months teaching everybody that nothing is ever re
ally lost because it made our own conduct look better."
\par Neville said, "Then we need an argument that a conserved thing can still be a harm."
\par "Yes."
\par "Have we got one?"
\par "Beatrix has got one," said Fainrose, "and it is the best legal argument I have ever seen and it is going to require us to stand up in front of forty-one signatories and say that our own defence from Book One was rubbish."
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
