\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 The vote on item 9(c) was taken at five past five.
\par Fourteen in favour of discontinuation. Nine against. Sixteen abstentions, and Beatrix afterwards said that the sixteen abstentions were the whole of the day's information, because an abstention is what a delegate files when he has been persuaded and canno
t say so.
\par Discontinuation of the Galactic Health Support Programme with effect from the end of the subscription year. Assets to be realised. Field maintenance to cease on the ninth of February. Records to be lodged with the Office of the President.
\par The chair asked whether there was any other business under the item.
\par The delegate for the Fourth Concordance said that she wished to record, for the minutes, that the Concordance had maintained subscription across its own volume for four hundred years before accession and had ceased on accession because the common fund mad
e it redundant, and that it no longer possessed the capability to resume, and that neither did anybody else, and that this had been the point of a common fund.
\par The chair thanked the delegate and said the observation would be recorded.
\par It was recorded. Neville obtained the minutes eleven weeks later and read the paragraph. It was two lines long, and it did not name the consequence, and the word }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 supernova}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  appeared nowhere in the document at any point.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
