\par "You did not win," he said.
\par "No," said Beatrix.
\par "You will want to know why, because you were right." He took his hat from the girl. "It is not because they did not follow you, Ms Sloan. Eleven of them followed you exactly and I watched their faces. It is that you offered them a difficult truth with a b
ill attached, and he offered them a true sentence with a refund attached, and the sentence was }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 true}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
