\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Neville wrote, in volume five, in a hotel in Vienna:
\par The Programme kept the walls written on.\line That was all it did. For eleven thousand years.\line Its performance indicator was that nothing occurred.
\par Then:
\par Fusion is tunnelling. All of it.\line A star is an exponential amplifier of the price of nothing.\line Two per cent for six hours does not cause. It advances.
\par Then, underlined:
\par He did not lie. Not once. That is the method.\line A true sentence, cut away from the person who said it, cannot be corrected.\line Conservation is not a defence to taking.
\par Then:
\par Fourteen for. Nine against. Sixteen abstentions.\line The abstentions were the information.
\par And last:
\par 9 February.\line 206 cores.\line The word does not appear in the minutes.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs36\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
Physics
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Chapter Five carries }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 black hole complementarity and the firewall problem}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 , and \emdash  through item seven of Annex C 
\emdash  the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 tunnelling basis of stellar fusion}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  and how core-collapse supernovae are triggered.

\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Complementarity.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  
Susskind, Thorlacius and Uglum proposed in 1993 that the black hole information paradox dissolves if one abandons the assumption that a single global description must exist. To an outside observer, information never enters the hole; it is smeared on the s
tretched horizon and returns in the radiation. To an infalling observer, nothing special happens at the horizon and the interior is an ordinary place. Both accounts are internally consistent, and no observer can perform an experiment that compares them, b
ec
ause to check the outside account you must stay out, and to check the inside account you must go in and cannot report back. There is no contradiction because there is no vantage point from which to have one. This is the doctrine the Office of the Presiden
t relies upon, and it is stated fairly in the chapter.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Why it fails: the firewall argument.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
 In 2012 Almheiri, Marolf, Polchinski and Sully (AMPS) showed that the two accounts cannot be reconciled after all, and the reason is the theorem this series established in Book One, Chapter Fifteen: }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 monogamy of entanglement}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
. For the outside account to work, a late Hawking quantum must be maximally correlated with the radiation already emitted. For the infalling account to work \emdash  for the horizon to be an unremarkable region of empty space \emdash 
 that same quantum must be maximally correlated with its partner just inside. Monogamy forbids both:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx916\tx1832\tx2748\tx3664\tx4580\tx5496\tx6412\tx7328\tx8244\tx9160\tx10076\tx10992\tx11908\tx12824\tx13740\tx14656\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \\text\{if \} S(A\{:\}B) \\text\{ is maximal, then \} I(A\{:\}C) = 0
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
Something must give. If the outside account is preserved, the near-horizon partner correlation is absent, and an infalling observer meets not empty space but a wall of high-energy quanta \emdash  a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 firewall}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
. The paradox remains unresolved; the leading candidates involve the entanglement wedge and the Page curve, and the field has not settled. What matters for the chapter is that Beatrix's legal move is sound: complementarity's promise that the two accounts 
may never be compared is exactly what monogamy destroys, and so the comparison is not forbidden but decisive, and a measured correlation deficit \emdash  S = 2.41 against a ceiling of 2 and a prediction of 2.8 \emdash 
 is physical evidence of loss rather than an artefact of choosing a description.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Unitarity is not a defence.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
 The Office's third argument is true and irrelevant, and the distinction deserves stating plainly. Unitary evolution conserves information globally. It says nothing about }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
locality, accessibility, or custody}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
. Information can be perfectly conserved and simultaneously scrambled beyond any practical recovery, or removed to a screen no party can read. "The accounts balance" and "nothing has happened" are different propositions, and conflating them is the oldest 
move in institutional history.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Item seven: why stars are the most sensitive instrument in the sky.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
 The Sun's core is at roughly }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 1.5 \\times 10^7}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  
K, corresponding to particle energies near 1 keV. The Coulomb barrier between two protons is of order 1 MeV \emdash  a factor of about a thousand too high. Classically, the Sun cannot burn. Fusion proceeds entirely by }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 quantum tunnelling}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 , with the penetration probability given by the Gamow factor:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx916\tx1832\tx2748\tx3664\tx4580\tx5496\tx6412\tx7328\tx8244\tx9160\tx10076\tx10992\tx11908\tx12824\tx13740\tx14656\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 P \\sim \\exp\\!\\left(-\\sqrt\{\\frac\{E_G\}\{E\}\}\\right)
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
Because the rate is exponential in the barrier, stellar cores amplify any change in barrier conditions enormously. A fractional change of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 10^\{-21\}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  in the vacuum floor is undetectable in a laboratory and unremarkable in a human life; run it through an exponential over }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 10^\{56\}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  participating nuclei and it becomes a measurable perturbation in energy generation.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Advancing, not causing.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
 Ramanathan's distinction is the physically honest one. A core-collapse supernova occurs when an iron core exceeds its }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Chandrasekhar mass}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  (}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \\approx 1.4\\,M_\\odot}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
) and electron degeneracy pressure \emdash  which does not increase with temperature \emdash 
 can no longer support it. Collapse follows in about a second, and 99% of the released energy leaves as neutrinos. Nothing external is needed to cause it; the star's own fuel e
xhaustion guarantees it. What a six-hour reduction in the vacuum floor can do is bring the schedule forward for a core already close to its limit. On stellar timescales an advance of eleven thousand years is nothing. On the timescale of anything living wi
thin thirty light years of the progenitor, it is everything, and the chapter's true horror is Annex C's willingness to list this as item seven of nine.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 Kastner's rule, applied to a budget line.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045  
The Programme's fatal weakness is structural rather than political, and it generalises well beyond fiction: a service whose only success condition is that nothing occurs cannot demonstrate value, accumulates no constituency, and is therefore the cheapest 
line to cut in any body that has been persuaded to simplify. This is Book One's central rule arriving at galactic scale \emdash  any institution that promises to make things simple is proposing to move complexity somewhere you cannot see \emdash 
 with the additional and grimmer observation that the move can be executed entirely out of true statements.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
What the reader learns
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls9\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid5709733 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
Complementarity resolves the information paradox by denying that any single observer can hold both the exterior and interior accounts.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Monogamy of entanglement (Book One, Chapter Fifteen) breaks that resolution: the same correlation would have to be spent twice, which implies a firewall at the horizon. The paradox is still open.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Unitarity conserves information globally but guarantees nothing about where it is or who can reach it; "the accounts balance" is not "no harm occurred".
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Stars burn only by tunnelling \emdash  the Coulomb barrier is about a thousand times core thermal energies \emdash 
 which makes stellar cores exponential amplifiers of vacuum conditions.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Core collapse is triggered when an iron core passes the Chandrasekhar mass and degeneracy pressure fails; external perturbations do not cause supernovae, they advance them.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}A programme whose success looks identical to inaction is structurally the easiest thing in any institution to defund.

\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
One-line summary
