the Page curve and the Chandrasekhar limit in the same room}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid13851045 
: Ramanathan has a list of two hundred and six cores and ninety days, Mrs Kind wants to know who inherits the Programme's assets when it is wound up, and Beatrix Sloan has stopped drafting a treaty and started drafting an injunction against a body with no
 territory, no army, and, it turns out, no address.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs36\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
