\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
An Eternal Golden Braid
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
The letter came in on the general tray, which by June had become the most productive intelligence source in the department, and it was forty-one pages long, and eleven of them were music.
\par Dear Department,
\par My name is Dougbart Stadthof and I restore organs. Cathedral, parish, and one dreadful thing in a hotel in Harrogate. I also translate, badly, from three languages, for pleasure, and I have been told by two separate people whose opinion I respect that I s
hould either publish or stop talking.
\par I am writing because of your Statement of Coherence for the period ending 31 March, and specifically because of the sentence in paragraph 22 in which you say that the Counsel's founding instrument "does not admit of an interpretation under which the Offic
e may be compelled".
\par I think it admits of exactly one, and I think it is the interpretation the instrument cannot survive, and I have enclosed it as Appendix D.
\par Appendices A, B and C are a unified theory of everything and you should probably not read them. I have called it the Eternal Golden Braid. My wife has asked me not to use that title in correspondence with government departments and I have agreed and then 
done it anyway, which is, if you think about it, the whole subject.
\par Yours,
\par D. Stadthof
\par Neville read Appendix D on the Monday and telephoned him on the Monday.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
