\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 It was Miss Pike who, at some point after eleven, said the thing that made Neville write the chapter up as a chapter rather than a minute.
\par "Mavis," she said.
\par The support unit in the corner, which had been in the corner since the reorganisation and had been used, in nineteen months, principally as a place to put coats, said: "Present."
\par "Mavis-9, are you consistent?"
\par A pause of about three seconds, which for Mavis-9 was geological.
\par "I can confirm that no inconsistency has been detected within my own operation," said Mavis-9.
\par "That isn't what I asked."
\par "No," said Mavis-9. "It is what I am able to answer. Miss Pike, if I were to certify my own consistency, my certification would be worthless in exactly the degree that it was confident. I am able to tell you that I have found nothing. I am not able to tel
l you that there is nothing. The distinction is in my documentation and nobody has ever read it."
\par Stadthof put both hands flat on the table.
\par "Mrs Kind," he said, "I have waited my whole life to hear a machine say that in a government building, and I want to note that it did not say it until somebody asked."
\par "That's the invitation clause again," said Neville.
\par "It is the invitation clause }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 everywhere}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
," said Dougbart Stadthof. "That is Appendix A, that is the whole of the Braid, and I shall spare you the three hundred pages and give you the one sentence, and then I shall go and catch my train.
\par "Every system that is rich enough to describe itself has a place it cannot reach from inside. The fugue cannot say where it turned round. The hands cannot draw the paper. The Austrian's arithmetic cannot certify its own soundness. Your Counsel cannot deci
de its own competence. Dr Ramanathan's nine stars cannot be settled by any calculation. And your machine in the corner cannot vouch for itself, and knows it, and said so the moment it was asked and not one moment before.
\par "That is not a defect. That is what having an inside }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 is}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
. And the only thing anybody can do about it \emdash  the only move, in every one of those cases \emdash  is that }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
somebody outside has to look, and somebody inside has to be asked}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
. Your Programme was eleven thousand years of somebody outside looking. Your President has abolished it on the grounds that nothing had gone wrong, which is precisely the certificate that no system is entitled to issue about itself.
\par "I have called that the Eternal Golden Braid and it is a ridiculous name for it and I am too old to change it now."
\par He got his coat.
\par "You will want the fourth strand," he said, from the door.
\par Neville said, "There's a fourth strand?"
\par "There is always a fourth strand, Mr Wren, that is the trouble with braids." Stadthof smiled. "The Austrian starved to death. He would not eat unless his wife tasted the food, and she went into hospital, and he stopped, and the man who proved that no syst
em can vouch for itself died because he could not obtain external verification of his dinner." He put his hat on. "I mention it because you have a hungry immortal on your files who will not enter a building without being asked, and I read the whole of you
r Statement of Coherence including the schedules, and I do not think anybody in this department has yet noticed that he is the same shape as the theorem."
