\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 Neville wrote, at one in the morning:
\par A fugue that rises for ever and arrives home.\line Two hands drawing each other.\line A sentence that says it cannot be proved.\line The same object. Three trades. One century.
\par Then:
\par Any system rich enough to describe itself has a place it cannot reach.\line No such system can certify its own consistency.\line The ones that issue the certificate are the broken ones.
\par Then:
\par Article 2 is the sentence.\line The motion cannot be passed or rejected.\line We have frozen it. That is the crime from Book One. Do it anyway. Minute that we know.
\par Then, underlined twice:
\par The cancellation is suspended. The handover is not.\line Papers went across 11 June.\line They have the map of every thin place in the galaxy.
\par Then:
\par Nine cores. Not insufficient data. No computable answer.\line Undecidable. In a star.
\par And last:
\par Mavis said it the moment she was asked.\line Nineteen months. Nobody asked.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs36\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
Physics and mathematics
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 Chapter Six carries }{\rtlch\fcs1 
\ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G\'f6del's incompleteness theorems}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 , their computational twin the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 halting problem}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 , and the fact \emdash  not the metaphor \emdash  that }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 undecidability occurs in physics}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 .
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 The first incompleteness theorem.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  G\'f6
del proved in 1931 that any consistent, effectively axiomatised formal system strong enough to express elementary arithmetic contains statements that are true but unprovable within it. The machinery is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G\'f6del numbering}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
: every formula and every proof is assigned a natural number, so that statements about provability become statements about arithmetic, and the system acquires the capacity to talk about itself. The }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 diagonal lemma}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  then permits construction of a sentence }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  asserting, in effect, "}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  is not provable in }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 F}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 ". If }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 F}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  proves }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 , }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 F}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  proves a falsehood. If }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 F}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
 is sound, it cannot prove }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  \emdash  and }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  is therefore true. Adding }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 G}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  as an axiom does not help; the enlarged system generates a new such sentence. Incompleteness is a property of formal expressive power, not of any particular axiom set.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 The second theorem}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 , which is the one Beatrix needs: no such system can prove its own consistency. 
}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 F \\nvdash \\mathrm\{Con\}(F)}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 . A body that certifies itself has, by that act, said nothing 
\emdash  and if it insists, the insistence is evidence against it.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 Turing's version.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  
Turing showed in 1936 that no algorithm can decide, for arbitrary program and input, whether the program halts. This is the same phenomenon in computational dress, and it is the form in which incompleteness leaks into the physical world.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 Undecidability in physics, which is the chapter's real weight.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  In 2015, Cubitt, P\'e9rez-Garc\'ed
a and Wolf proved that the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 spectral gap problem}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  
is undecidable: given an exact description of a translationally invariant many-body Hamiltonian on a lattice, there is no algorithm that determines in finite time whether the system is gapped or gapless. The proof embeds a universal Turing machine in the 
ground-state structure. Related results establish undecidability for whether certain quantum measurement outcomes ever occur, and for various questions in classical dynamics. The consequence is genuinely strange and genuinely established: there exist phys
ical systems about which a specific, well-posed, perfectly finite question has }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 no computable answer}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 , and no improvement in instrumentation or data touches it. Ramanathan's nine cores are fiction; her reason is not.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 The Hofstadter strand.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  G\'f6
del, Escher, Bach: an Eternal Golden Braid (Hofstadter, 1979) argues that G\'f6del's self-reference, Escher's impossible recursions \emdash  Drawing Hands, Print Gallery, the endlessly rising staircase \emdash 
 and Bach's canons, especially the modulating canon that ascends through six keys and returns to its origin, are the same structure realised in logic, image and sound. Hofstadter calls the structure a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 strange loop}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
: a hierarchy that, traversed upward, returns to its starting level. Stadthof's ambition to make this a physical theory of everything is his own, and the chapter is careful to let the room decline the three hundred pages and keep the eleven.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 Why the legal move is not a trick.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  
Self-referential authority clauses are real and are a known defect. G\'f6del's own reported claim \emdash  prepared for his 1947 naturalisation hearing, with Einstein and Morgenstern present \emdash 
 was that the US Constitution contained a chain of provisions permitting 
lawful establishment of a dictatorship. Article 2 of the Counsel's instrument grants the Office competence to determine the extent of its own competence, which makes the instrument a system containing its own metatheory. Beatrix's motion is a G\'f6
del sentence in procedural form: every available disposition of it presupposes the point at issue, so no disposition is valid, so it remains pending \emdash 
 and pendency, under the instrument's own suspension provision, is the remedy. The chapter's honesty is in having her name what she has done: she has weaponised indefinite non-resolution, which is the offence the first book prosecuted.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 The connecting principle.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366  Stadthof's single usable sentence \emdash 
 that a system rich enough to describe itself cannot reach certain truths from the inside, and that the only remedy is external verification, obtained by asking \emdash  ties the series' devices together: the invitation clause 
that constrains Weinstein, the holographic requirement of a boundary description, the Programme's function as eleven thousand years of outside looking, and Mavis-9's refusal to certify herself. The final strand is biographical and true: G\'f6
del, who proved that no system can vouch for itself, died of inanition in 1978 because he would eat only food his wife had tasted, and she was hospitalised.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel2\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs27 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs27\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 
