\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Turing's halting problem is the computational form of the same result.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid5398366 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Undecidability is physically real \emdash 
