\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 He did the commons first, because he said it was the easy half and people should be allowed one easy half.
\par "Forty-one signatories," he said. "A common fund. Each pays a small sum annually. The benefit is diffuse, the cost is specific, and no member's own contribution is individually decisive. What is each member's best move, taking the others' moves as fixed?"

\par "To stop paying," said Neville.
\par "To stop paying. Always. In every single case, whatever the others do." Nashville drew nothing; he simply held up a hand and counted on it. "If everyone else pays, you get the maintained galaxy free. If nobody else pays, your payment is wasted. There is n
o configuration of other players' choices in which paying is your best reply. That is not greed and it does not require a villain. It is the structure. The unique stable point of that game \emdash 
 the point where no player can improve by changing his own move alone \emdash  is that nobody pays and the walls go slack."
\par "Then how did it run for eleven thousand years?" said Fainrose.
\par "That," said Jack Nashville, "is the actual question, and it is the only interesting thing about item nine C, and nobody at the session asked it. They asked whether the Programme delivered value. They should have asked what had been }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 holding it together}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 , because on the plain analysis it should have collapsed in the first century."
\par He looked round at them.
\par "The usual answer is the future. If a game is played repeatedly and indefinitely, and defection can be observed and punished, cooperation becomes stable \emdash 
 not from virtue, from arithmetic. But that requires observation and it requires punishment, and your
 Counsel has no army, no territory, and until June no address. It cannot punish anybody. Something else was doing the work." He nodded at Mrs Kind. "Which is why I came about the leases."
