\par "Eleven leased premises," she said. "I could not make them make sense. A body that maintains screens across a galaxy does not need eleven rooms, and if it did need rooms it would need them near the work, and these are not near anything. Two in the Atacama
, one in a Cumbrian mineshaft \emdash  which I will come back to because that is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 van Casteel's}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384  
mineshaft and the lease predates him by four hundred years \emdash  one in Svalbard, one under a Swiss hillside, four at sites the schedule gives only by coordinate, and two in Vienna."
\par "And the rent?" said Beatrix.
\par "Nominal. A peppercorn in nine of them. But the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 service charge}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 
 is enormous and it is all one line item, and the line item is described as\emdash " she found it \emdash  "}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 maintenance of held correlations, replenishment as required.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 "
\par Nashville said, "There it is."
\par "There what is?" said Neville.
\par "Your enforcement mechanism," said Nashville. "Those eleven rooms are not offices. They are where the shared correlations are kept. And once you know that, everything about your instrument makes sense, including the parts your lawyers have been calling ba
dly drafted."
\par He turned to Beatrix.
\par "Ms Sloan. When you drafted your motion in Vienna you were trying to bind forty-one parties by words. Words require a forum, and a forum requires a bailiff, and there is no bailiff. The founding parties knew that in the first century. So they did not buil
d a legal instrument. They built a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 game they could not cheat at}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 
