\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8355384 Neville wrote, at midnight:
\par Forty-one payers, diffuse benefit, specific cost.\line Not paying is the best reply to every configuration.\line The stable point is slack walls. No villain required.
\par Then:
\par It ran 11,000 years because it was not a treaty.\line Eleven rooms. Held correlations. Replenishment as required.\line Defection was not punished. It was visible.\line Classical ceiling 75%. With correlation 85%. Grid game: 100%.\line 
You cannot fake your way above a theorem.
\par Then, underlined:
\par Monogamy caps the membership. Nine. Out of forty-one.\line We will have to choose, and everyone left out will be right about us.
\par Then:
\par These games have no optimal play.\line Approximating the best score is the halting problem.\line More correlation always helps and never suffices.\line He will propose an undecidable game in October. We drew him the plans in Vienna.
\par Then:
\par 4C crossed over in 1961.\line The clerk filed it wrong in 1961.\line No conclusion. Box it.
\par And last:
\par Ravenna. 1338. Nine years.\line He stands in lobbies because he knows what his own certificate is worth.\line So should we.
