\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 They broke for twenty minutes and nobody left the room.
\par It was Priya Ramanathan who came back at it, from a direction nobody expected, and Neville afterwards thought that this was the moment the department stopped being a department that received experts and became one that had an argument of its own.
\par "Professor Eugenius," she said. "I accept the whole of that and I want to hand you a bill for it."
\par "By all means."
\par "You've told us that mathematics works only in the domains that proved amenable, and that we defined physics as the amenable part. Fine. But you have not asked the second question, which is }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 why any domain is amenable at all}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 
. Why is there a regime in which three lines of algebra predict a planet for a thousand years? That is not a selection effect. Selection explains which subjects we admitted to the club. It does not explain why the club exists."
\par Eugenius put his hands together and said, "Go on. This is why I telephoned."
\par "The answer is decoherence, and I think it is the answer to your essay and I don't think anybody has put it to you in those terms." Ramanathan went to the board. "A system in contact with an environment does not stay in arbitrary superpositions. The envir
onment monitors it constantly \emdash  every photon, every air molecule, every gravitational whisper \emdash 
 and monitoring destroys the delicate combinations extremely fast. A dust grain in sunlight loses coherence in something like ten to the minus twenty seconds. Not
hing survives that except a very small, very particular set of states: the ones the environment happens to be measuring, the ones that get copied rather than scrambled. Those are the pointer states. Everything else is gone before it can be written down.

\par "And here is the thing, Professor. The pointer states are exactly the states with }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 simple, stable, local, robust}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496  descriptions. That is not a coincidence; it is the selection criterion. What survives contact with an environment is what can be redundantly recorded, and what can be redundantly recorded is what can be }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 summarised}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 
. Position, momentum, charge, a definite pointer reading. The environment is running a sieve, continuously, everywhere, and the sieve's output is a world made of the few structures that admit short descriptions."
\par She turned round.
\par "Mathematics is unreasonably effective because we are living downstream of a filter that removes everything mathematics could not have handled. There was never a miracle. There is a sieve, and the sieve is decoherence, and it runs on the environment, and 
the environment is\emdash "
\par She stopped.
\par Fainrose said it.
\par "\emdash the screens."
\par "The screens," said Ramanathan. "Full subscription is what continuous monitoring looks like from inside. That is what the Programme was buying for eleven thousand years. Not tidiness. Not safety. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 Classicality.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 "
\par Viktor Eugenius sat for some time without saying anything at all.
\par "I have been arguing that essay for sixty-five years," he said eventually, "and no one has ever answered it, and I did not expect to be answered on a Wednesday in Marsham Street by a woman half my age with a plot of a supernova in her hand."
\par "I'd rather I hadn't been right," said Ramanathan.
\par "So would I, madam. Because you understand what you have just told me." He looked round the table. "If the effectiveness of mathematics is a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 service}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 , then it has a supplier, and the supplier's line item was cancelled in Vienna. And the failure will not announce itself as physics breaking down. It will announce itself as things becoming }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \i\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 slightly less predictable than they used to be}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 
, in domains where nobody keeps records good enough to notice, for about a century, and then all at once."
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid8469496 
