The arrow requires the Past Hypothesis, a postulated low-entropy initial condition of extreme specialness (of order one part in }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f2\fs20\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid6510635 10^\{10^\{123\}\}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
