\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid6510635 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}Without it, Boltzmann brains with false memories dominate \emdash  a reductio on doing without the postulate.
