\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 Neville wrote, that night:
\par Part one was the feint. Undecidable game, filed correctly, eleven weeks early.\line It bears on nothing, because we stopped testing the score in June.\line A man who denies time saved us with a pedantic objection to a subordinate clause.\line 
Write that down properly. Tell Barbarian. He wants a receipt.
\par Then:
\par Fine-tuning is real. Strong force a few per cent. n-p mass difference 1 part in 1000.\line Ripples 1 in 10^5. Vacuum energy 10^-122 against a prediction of order 1.\line 120 orders of magnitude. The worst failure of prediction we have.
\par Then:
\par Weak anthropic = selection effect on samples. Uncontroversial. Explains nothing.\line Best use: 1953, carbon, a resonance at 7.65 MeV, predicted then found.\line It works when it only chooses the question and real physics does the rest.
\par Then, underlined twice:
\par The swindle is in the joint.\line 'Observers find themselves in a permissive band' becomes 'you are here, so nothing went wrong'.\line It bounds the WORST the past could have been. It certifies nothing.\line 
Every harm short of extinction becomes self-refuting.
\par Do not answer it. DATE it.\line It is a statement about the past in the tense of a guarantee.\line Survival to now is consistent with any severity beginning tomorrow.
\par Then:
\par The Concordance kept 400 years of records keyed to a star.\line The star is the one at 12 degrees.\line Consistent, redundant, genuine, and mute.\line The only test that defeats forgery requires readable copies.\line 
The only honest member cannot produce one.\line The key was destroyed by the thing the Programme existed to prevent.
\par Then:
\par Barbour's rock with strata, and no light.\line He said he was ashamed of how interesting he found it. He said it out loud. Note that he said it out loud.
\par And last:
\par She told him the truth: the rule was never addressed to him.\line Verified means summonable. He asked for an external check for 688 years and the price is the lobby.\line 
He would not use the argument from being here. He is the only one in this file who wouldn't.\line He lied to the widow in the eleventh year and says he would do it again and that this is why the rule cannot be left to him.
\par That is the most honest sentence anybody has said to me in two books.
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0\afs36 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\fs36\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 
Physics
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 Chapter Eleven carries }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 fine-tuning}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743  and the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 anthropic principle}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 , and the difference between a selection effect and an excuse.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 The fine-tunings are real and should not be minimised.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743  
A number of dimensionless parameters appear to admit only narrow ranges compatible with complex structure:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar
