\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743  Reasoning from the observed cosmic abundance of carbon, Hoyle inferred that the triple-alpha process must be resonantly enhanced by an excited state of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 
