sim 10^\{500\}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743  vacua) is the standard candidate, but it is unconfirmed, and it brings the unsolved }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
