: probabilistic statements require a measure over an infinite ensemble, and the natural choices produce pathologies, including the domination of }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743 Boltzmann brains}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\kerning0\insrsid14645859\charrsid12780743  \emdash  fluctuation-produced observers with false memories \emdash 
