\s35\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 What Soccermann had said about Weinstein}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 , in pages five to eleven, which was the part that made the department go quiet.
\par He had sat down opposite Halpert Weinstein in a room off the Ringstrasse on the fifth of May 1906, in the chair the founders had paid for, as the second unaffiliated observer in eleven thousand years, and he had asked the question the clause required, whi
ch is whether what this party had taken was a thing anybody needed.
\par And then, because he was a physicist and could not help himself, he had spent eleven pages working out what Weinstein }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 was}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 .
\par Mrs Kind read it out.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
The creature described to me feeds upon the alternatives which are discarded when a matter resolves. I take this to mean that it consumes precisely the difference between the many arrangements which were possible and the one which obtained \emdash 
 which is to say, it eats }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs38\i\f2\fs20\insrsid14645859 \\ln W}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 .}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 It then reports that it deposits some portion of what it takes into a sealed chamber in England, and has done so on several occasions, and regards this as prudence rather than virtue.}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
I must therefore consider whether I am sitting opposite a mechanism of the sort Maxwell described in his letter: a small intelligence which sorts, and thereby produces order without expenditure, and which if it existed would permit the construction of an 
engine drawing work from a single heat bath for ever. Such an engine is impossible. I am obliged either to find the error in what I have been told, or to find where the account is paid.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 The creature is not lying. I have tested it on matters where I could check.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 I therefore state where the account is paid, and I state it as a prediction so that it may be refuted by whoever reads this.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
Sorting requires knowing which to sort. Knowing requires a record. And a sorter which must sort again must first clear the record of the previous sorting, or it will fill and stop. The clearing is the cost. Not the looking; not the choosing; the forgettin
g. I cannot compute the amount and I believe it will prove to be a fixed quantity per distinction cleared, proportional to the temperature, and I regret that I have not the years to do it properly.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 And therefore, if the creature has taken }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af2\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs38\i\f2\fs20\insrsid14645859 \\ln W}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859  
from the world for eleven thousand years and returned some of it, and is not thereby an impossible engine, there is only one place the account can have been kept, and it is the reason I have written eleven pages about a man's manner rather than his mathem
atics.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 He does not forget anything.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
He named for me, without notes, and in order, and with the weather, the discarded alternatives of a woman in Ravenna in the winter of 1338. He was not showing off. He was distressed, and could not stop, and apologised, and continued.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
That is the ledger. The entropy he removes from the world is not destroyed and is not paid by the chamber in England. It is held, in him, as a perfect and unerasable record, and it accumulates, and it cannot be discharged, because the only discharge avail
able to a mechanism of this kind is to forget, and he is constitutionally unable to do so.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 He is not a violation of the second law. He is its collateral.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 
As to the question I was required to answer: he told me that what he had taken had been needed. I do not believe him. I record that I do not believe him, and I record that I asked him three times, and I record that on the third occasion he said "no", and 
then asked me not to write it down, and I have written it down, because a room paid for by forty-one parties for eleven thousand years is not a room in which a man is entitled to be kind.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 L. Soccermann, 5 May 1906.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-14\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
