\s35\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 Neville wrote, that night, and it took him longer than usual:
\par S = k log W.\line Entropy is a count of the arrangements that would look the same to you at the level you can look.\line Not a fluid. Not a tendency. A logarithm of your own coarseness.
\par Then:
\par The second law is not a law. Ordered outcomes are outnumbered, not forbidden.\line Loschmidt: reverse every velocity and you get a lawful decrease. Zermelo: a bounded system recurs.\line Both objections correct. He accepted both. They heard weakness.
\line Ninety years later they measured the fluctuations with a bead in water. He was right in the only way available and saw no experiment.
\par Then:
\par A demon does not pay for looking. It pays for FORGETTING. kT ln2 per bit cleared.\line A demon with infinite memory is not impossible. It is only never discharged.\line Eleven thousand years, unerasable, and he recites them when he is distressed,\line 
and a physician's note in 1906 called that evidence and everyone since has called it a mannerism.
\par He is not a violation of the second law. He is its collateral.\line The only relief available to him would discharge into whatever room he was standing in.
\par Then, underlined twice:
\par You cannot fake mutual information. It is not a property of the marks.\line A forged archive is thermodynamically dead \emdash  not weaker, dead.\line Extractable work \u8804\'3d kT \'d7 I. So you can weigh an archive without reading a word of it.\line 
Amend 11: not readable copies. Demonstrable correlation.\line Pike: 'a forger would have to actually correlate it with an actual four hundred years. That is just doing it.'
\par Then:
\par He asked Soccermann not to write it down. Soccermann wrote it down.\line 'A room paid for by forty-one parties for eleven thousand years is not a room in which a man is entitled to be kind.'
\par Then:
\par Weinstein on the two worst things the living do to the dead.\line The second is making the death about themselves.\line The first is filing it.
\par We filed Soccermann for a hundred and twenty years because nobody submitted a request.\line I have put in a request for a translation of every document in that strong room.\line There are four hundred and nine.
\par And last:
\par 74 days.
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\s2\ql \fi-14\li144\ri0\sb160\sa80\sl259\slmult1\keep\keepn\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\outlinelevel1\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31503\afs32\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
\fs32\cf19\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\loch\af31502\hich\af31502\dbch\af31501\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31503 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 \hich\af31502\dbch\af31501\loch\f31502 Physics
