\s35\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 Weinstein waited until the plates had gone, and then said:
\par "Mr Drill. I am the man who made the argument, and I am not going to pretend to be neutral. I want to put the objection I put to the Ministry in nineteen \emdash  forgive me, in the year before last, in this building, at two in the morning.
\par "You say I combined two benches. Very well. But my observation is not a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 measurement of a property}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
. I am not claiming to have measured the momentum of anything. I am reporting an }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 absence of consumption}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
. I ate nothing. Nothing was there to eat. That is not a claim about position or momentum or any conjugate pair. It is a claim about whether a transaction occurred, and I am the counterparty."
\par "Yes," said Drill. "Yes. That is \emdash  that is the good objection and I have been thinking about it for eleven days and I want to give you the answer that I think is true rather than the one that wins.
\par "Your feeding is a coupling. It is not passive. You have told this department that you consume the difference between what could have happened and what did \emdash  which means your apparatus, whatever it is, is coupled to the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 
\ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 branch structure}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859  
of the resolution. That is a specific arrangement. And an arrangement coupled to branch structure is not compatible with an arrangement that records definite outcomes in a register, for the same reason that a which-path detector is not compatible with an 
interference pattern. If you can taste the branches, the branches are not resolved. If the register has a definite entry, the branches are gone. You cannot have a bench that does both, and on the fourteenth of March there were two benches and you have bee
n treating them as one room."
\par Weinstein sat back.
\par "Then what am I?" he said.
\par "You are an instrument that has never been characterised," said Nelson Drill, "and I have spent thirty-six years being paid to tell people that an uncharacterised instrument is not evidence, it is a }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\cs36\i\insrsid14645859 lead}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 ."
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-14\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
