\s35\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa100\sbauto1\saauto1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 
\ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 What it cost, and what it saved}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 , took until Thursday.
\par Fainrose put it on the board on the Wednesday evening and did not soften it.
\par "Chapter Three is invalid as reasoned," she said. "The nine were right to send him and I want that minuted before anybody gets defensive. We inferred determination from an absence measured on an uncharacterised instrument and we published it in a Statemen
t of Coherence."
\par Miss Pike said, "Is the conclusion wrong?"
\par "That's the thing." Fainrose turned round. "Read Mr Drill's objection carefully and it does not attack the drainage account. It attacks the }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 route}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
. And when I redo it his way \emdash  when I insist that everything be stated as a fact about a system }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 together with the arrangement it was in}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859  
\emdash  the finding does not weaken.
\par "It gets worse for us."
\par She wrote it out.
\par "Chapter Three said: the fourteen had both permitted options extinguished, so the barrier was already nothing, so they drained. And the implied moral was that the Ministry's register had }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 thinned}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859  them, which is bad enough.
\par "Drill's version says something sharper. There is no fact about which options a pending state 'has' independent of the arrangement that defines the options. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 The register was the arrangement.}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 
 The permitted options were not a description of two doors that happened to exist in the world; they were the two doors the bench was built to detect, and outside the bench there were no doors at all and no facts about doors.
\par "So we did not merely fail to notice that Ellen Prosper's options had closed. We were the apparatus that determined what counted as an option for her, we specified the arrangement, we maintained it monthly for nineteen months, and the question of whether 
anything else was available to her had }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs37\b\insrsid14645859 no answer}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859  while our bench was the only bench in the room.
\par "That is not a failure of monitoring. That is a much older offence and Mr Drill has just handed the plaintiffs a better cause of action than the one they have."
\par Beatrix Sloan, who had been silent for two hours, said: "Yes. And I have to advise the nine of it by Friday, and I am going to."
\par }\pard\plain \ltrpar\ql \fi-14\li144\ri0\sl259\slmult1\widctlpar\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin144\itap0\pararsid14645859 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 
