\par "He went back to his guns," said Fainrose, "and he was dead within the year, and the Prussian Academy heard his first solution read aloud by a man too astonished to wait for the war to end, and his second solution sat in a drawer in this building addresse
d to nobody in particular for a hundred and nine years because the docket said }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ai\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cs36\i\insrsid14645859 pending confirmation of survival}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859  and nobody checked."
