\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\ls27\adjustright\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid5709733 \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507\afs24\alang1025 \ltrch\fcs0 \f31506\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\kerning2\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 
\ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid14645859 A real physical measurement (a Casimir-plate force) can be used to test for the presence of an otherwise invisible structure (a propped-open wormhole throat), turning metaphysics into an instrument reading.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid14645859 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
A throat's cross-section bounds its information-carrying capacity; "traversable" does not mean "usable," and a real wormhole can be simultaneously confirmed and practically inert.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid14645859 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
Undecidability in a formal system can flag that a question is malformed for the objects it's being asked about, rather than signalling failure of the mathematics.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af31507 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\fs20\kerning2\insrsid14645859 \loch\af3\dbch\af31506\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}
An apparently unpayable thermodynamic debt can have a real, measurable discharge mechanism that was simply never looked for.
